# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything here would be permanently public if committed. Treat an accidental
# commit as a compromised key: rotate it, do not merely delete the file.

# Local secrets. `.env.example` is the documented template and carries no
# values, so it is deliberately excepted.
.env*
!.env.example

# Unwraps every API key users save in Settings. With this file and a copy of
# the database, all of them are readable.
/.credential-key

*.pem
*.key
!**/public/**/*.key

# ── Databases ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These hold real accounts, courses and encrypted credentials.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
/courseai.db*
/test-*.db*
/backend/data/

# The PGlite era. Single-process directories, never openable twice.
/pgdata
/pgdata.*

# ── Dependencies and build output ────────────────────────────────────────────
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

/.next/
/out/
/build
/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.vercel

# Python: the virtual environment is 400 MB of installed packages that
# `pip install -r requirements.txt` reproduces exactly.
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# ── Local machine state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Logs, tool caches and browser profiles. A browser profile in particular can
# carry live session cookies.
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.dev.*.log
.codex*
/.playwright-mcp/
/.hyperresearch/
/research/

# ChromaDB vector memory. Local, and rebuildable from the courses table.
#
# Unanchored on purpose: the backend writes its own copy under backend/, and a
# leading slash matched only the one at the root. The other went into the first
# commit as 4.8 MB of binary index.
chroma-data/

# Screenshots and DOM snapshots captured from real job applications.
artifacts/

.DS_Store
